{%- assign bg_color = section.settings.bg_color | default: '#ffffff' -%}

<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,600;0,9..144,700;1,9..144,400&family=Inter:wght@500;600;700&display=swap');

  .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ bg_color }};
    padding: 60px 0 80px 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    position: relative;
  }

  .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__container {
    max-width: 1280px;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__grid {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 70px;
  }

  /* Left Column */
  .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__left {
    flex: 0 0 42%;
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Barlow', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: #F07290;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__heading {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 44px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: #261514;
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }

  .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__subtext,
  .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__subtext p {
    font-family: 'Barlow', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #6F5B58;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Right Column */
  .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__right {
    flex: 1 1 58%;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__text,
  .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__text p {
    font-family: 'Barlow', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #6F5B58;
    margin: 0 0 18px 0;
  }

  .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__text p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid #EAE0DF;
    margin: 30px 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__quote {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: #261514;
    margin: 0;
    padding:0;
    border: none;
    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
  }

  /* Responsive Breakpoints */
  @media screen and (max-width: 991px) {
    .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} {
      padding: 48px 0 60px 0;
    }

    .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__grid {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 36px;
    }

    .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__left {
      flex: 1 1 100%;
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__right {
      flex: 1 1 100%;
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__heading {
      font-size: 36px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__quote {
      font-size: 23px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 580px) {
    .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} {
      padding: 36px 0 48px 0;
    }

    .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__container {
      padding: 0 16px;
    }

    .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__heading {
      font-size: 28px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__subtext,
    .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__subtext p,
    .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__text,
    .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__text p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__quote {
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }} .cm-origin-story__divider {
      margin: 22px 0;
    }
  }
</style>

<section id="s--{{ section.id }}" class="cm-origin-story cm-origin-story--{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="cm-origin-story__container">
    <div class="cm-origin-story__grid">
      <!-- Left Column -->
      <div class="cm-origin-story__left">
        {% if section.settings.eyebrow != blank %}
          <p class="cm-origin-story__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if section.settings.heading != blank %}
          <h2 class="cm-origin-story__heading">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
        {% endif %}

        {% if section.settings.subtext != blank %}
          <div class="cm-origin-story__subtext">
            {{ section.settings.subtext }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column -->
      <div class="cm-origin-story__right">
        {% if section.settings.text_top != blank %}
          <div class="cm-origin-story__text">
            {{ section.settings.text_top }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if section.settings.quote != blank %}
          <hr class="cm-origin-story__divider" aria-hidden="true">
          <blockquote class="cm-origin-story__quote">
            {{ section.settings.quote }}
          </blockquote>
          <hr class="cm-origin-story__divider" aria-hidden="true">
        {% endif %}

        {% if section.settings.text_bottom != blank %}
          <div class="cm-origin-story__text">
            {{ section.settings.text_bottom }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Origin Story",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "bg_color",
      "label": "Background Color",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "Eyebrow Text",
      "default": "COOL MOM SPRINKLES’ ORIGIN STORY"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "It started with wanting to make the moment feel special."
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "subtext",
      "label": "Left Column Subtext",
      "default": "<p>Not a perfect Pinterest moment. A real one. A fun party, a cute cake, and that feeling when your kid’s face lights up.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_top",
      "label": "Right Column Top Text",
      "default": "<p>When I was a young mom, I loved throwing fun parties for my kids and making every memory count. There was nothing better than seeing their excitement when I nailed the theme and made something that felt special.</p><p>But I struggled with it. I wanted to be the mom who could whip up something delicious, beautiful, and homemade, but doing that on a budget was hard. I’d often have to buy ten different things to make one thing, and almost always ended up with more than I needed.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "quote",
      "label": "Highlighted Quote",
      "default": "“I wanted to help other regular moms making something special while doing twenty other things at once.”"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_bottom",
      "label": "Right Column Bottom Text",
      "default": "<p>I saw so many moms feeling like they couldn't make something special. They needed to know they were more than capable of making something that wowed their kids and friends and made them feel like a super mom.</p><p>That's when I began creating one-of-a-kind sprinkle mixes, so anyone could transform a simple dessert in mere minutes and only buy what they actually needed.</p><p>In 2011, I opened an Etsy shop selling sprinkles and custom birthday decorations so I could help people create fearlessly, make memories, and feel good about themselves.</p><p>Then in 2019, Cool Mom Sprinkles officially began. Today, the mission is still simple: fight against overpriced sprinkles and a lack of confidence in the kitchen.</p><p>I'm honored to help you sprinkle magic and pizzazz into everyday life, make events memorable, and celebrate with confidence.</p>"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Origin Story"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
